# CCMAF project marker + pins. PRESENCE of this file marks a CCMAF project
# (kernel/devhooks defer on presence); the FRAMEWORK_LINE=v2 CONTENT line is
# the ccmaf core plugin's activation key (CORE-DESIGN §0) — v1 projects have
# a version of this file WITHOUT that line, which keeps core inert there.
FRAMEWORK_LINE=v2
# Scaffold revision: /ccmaf:update applies scaffold deltas when this falls
# behind the plugin's shipped revision. Code updates ride `claude plugin
# update`, never this file. The value below is a FALLBACK ONLY — /ccmaf:init
# stamps this line from templates/.scaffold-rev at write time (single source
# of truth; round-2 review caught the two files diverging).
SCAFFOLD_REV=2
# Upstream reference (migration provenance + where to file feedback).
FRAMEWORK_UPSTREAM_URL=https://github.com/drushegh/CCMAF
